\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras/597ede2ac374cf12d7931c48eaae106a.poster.avif?t=1754557498\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras/597ede2ac374cf12d7931c48eaae106a.webm?t=1754557498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>",
